# Git push (Jason)

- **Commits:** The agent may stage and commit locally when finishing agreed work, unless Jason says commit-only or no commit.
- **Push:** Never run `git push` (any remote/branch) until Jason explicitly confirms in that chat (e.g. "yes push", "go ahead and push").
- **Before asking to push:** Show a short summary: repo path, branch, commit message(s) or `git log origin/main..HEAD --oneline`, and whether secrets scan / tests were run if relevant.
- **Multi-repo:** List each repo in the confirmation request; push only the repos Jason approves.
- **Profile repo:** Default branch for JsonCMorgan profile README is `main`, not feature branches.